 dict(id='cube-effect-original-output-perceive-and-post-write-known-pairing',Source_contract='L1EffectInstance.onPerceive requires equal showId and tryAddKnownObject before S_NPCPack_Eff. The packet carries actual object/geometry/template GFX with hidden HP. Effect creation and existence are separate from whether its player master remains available.',program_update='Actual four material and four native rebuild object-send ports attach frozen original placement audience or pre-Hub-wait rebuild binding, actual effect and native packet metadata to the original light output list. A dedicated typed original Output executes independently of retired caster root; original normal/stale/failure completion tails rescue unclaimed outputs exactly once without changing other outputs or completions. Original movement perception adds entering/leaving native screen and explicit rebuild refresh. Exact live cube pointer is indexed at accepted original publication under existing Hub-to-engine order. Final pre-cipher predicate validates original receiver role/scene/epoch/Main/expiry/object/geometry and screen; only a successful actual Protocol.writeFrame marks/removes known binding. Expired object only removes a matching original role that actually received it, not an unseen/replacement role or same-id replacement cube. Cache audience is released at expiry and stale seen bindings pruned; queued Work contains no Context/Batch/Action/Frame/Receipt. Existing encoders/resource transforms, HP/cost/RNG/SQL and other original outputs retained; no new scheduler/worker/TLS/queue.',remaining='No bound producer retirement/failure rescue/receiver waits/IO/movement/rebuild/expiry/Main/game/MySQL qualification. Actual template-GFX/data/resource numerical parity, full Source visibility-control mapping and full material/Source/AI/formal composition remain open; native screen mapping and original encoders are retained pending final same-SHA acceptance.'),
 dict(id='cube-actual-GameServer-bootstrap-global-phase-correction',correction='Earlier cadence evidence froze each EffectCube*Timer.start500 leaf but missed the actual production caller. GameServer instantiates StartTimer_Skill and calls start, which directly schedules all four Runnable objects with initial0/period1000 through aiScheduleAtFixedRate. It does not call their start500 methods. Those prior500-as-production program claims and one pure oracle are superseded.',Source_contract='Global per-type0/1000 effect scan proceeds even when there are no cubes. A placement waits the next service slot rather than starting an immediate per-cube phase. Target L1Cube remains separately scheduled900/1000; installed primary expiry/callbacks are independent from global new-effect scanning.',program_update='Four bounded primitive Phase cells on the original Hub initialize before original ground task registration, advance once per original synchronized type collector before any rooms, and release on original close. Four exact original new-effect deadline comparisons consume that shared type/slot. Empty rooms and different placements share service phase; delayed callbacks coalesce current live scans while next deadline retains fixed-rate phase. Original100ms owned drainer, independent status clocks, HP/FIFO/life/cost/RNG/output remain retained; no new schedule/worker/TLS/queue/actor retention or SQL. Original cadence Source branch corrected1000 and one inherited oracle corrected.',remaining='No actual bound Hub startup/multiroom/delay/clear/close/role/HP/Main/game/MySQL qualification; native owned drainer quantizes observation to its retained100ms schedule. Full effect-NPC presentation/visibility/resources, remaining Source/material/control/factory-AI/formal composition and concentrated final same-SHA matrix remain open.'),
 dict(id='cube-original-Source-role-and-match-bounded-new-status',Source_contract='EffectCubeExecutor keeps actual effect master separate from target; PC clause checks matching instance, original master nonnull, exact self, nonzero same clan and current party membership before hostile safety/war clause. Natural Monster clause is independently enemy. Installed target L1Cube status continues independently from master availability.',program_update='Four actual engine self comparisons and typed Alliance calls reuse original effect Entity creator Binding and original prewait target scan. Base Binding.capture bytecode proves source already stores sourceCharacterIdentity (not server name); use it directly for original clan/party lookups, never current sessions.get(casterId) or recomposition. Exact self requires the original source/account/selected/owner binding, so same-id replacement is not self. New hostile PC installs preserve original match PvP/team policy with original captured force and current actual target force; no inherited Ctrl intent. Original self/clan/party ally clause remains; non-PvP/friendly hostile paths ignored. Natural actors retain original kind/life/generation/faction clause. New scans require existing original Hub/engine ownership, current epoch, running match and OPEN admission; no new lock or owner metadata. Installed status/HP/output/cost/RNG/clocks and native unscoped/WORLD/BOT fallback remain unchanged.',remaining='No bound creator/target replacement, clan-party mutation, scene/admission race, HP/cost/final IO/Main/game/MySQL qualification. Global initial effect scan phase, effect-NPC presentation/resource/visibility, full Source material/controls/factory-AI/formal composition and concentrated final same-SHA validation remain open.'),
 dict(id='cube-Source-config-GFX-original-relation-output-order',Source_contract='EffectCubeExecutor selects SkillsTable castgfx for allies and castgfx2 for enemies, including Harmony. Ally own attributes precede target sound. Natural L1MonsterInstance takes the enemy clause. S_SkillSound writes object and16bit GFX, including zero.',program_update='Eight actual PC/natural primary-status visual call sites use existing immutable readonly skill metadata. Actual Harmony relation is stored on the exact original status before map publication; later scene relation or same-id replacement cannot rewrite it. Source ally attribute synchronization precedes effect and original duplicate attribute tail is skipped only inside the same original Source raw context; typed bridge calls original private status body. Natural targets select enemy GFX. Source zero is encoded without substituting native defaults; positive native resource remapping remains. Exact existing final role/life/index/range/close guards and HP/cost/RNG/SQL stay retained. Quake/Shock existing installed predicate also refuses expired bound actual cells after waits.',remaining='No bound Source role/cost/status IO/MP/HP/Main/game/MySQL qualification. Actual source reader against Chinese MySQL, full effect-NPC presentation/resource selection, target eligibility and relation/clan/party/safety mapping, first global scan phase and full Source/material/formal composition remain open.'),
