 dict(id='cube-actual-material-factory-and-scan-correction',correction='Earlier cube-origin metadata covered legacy GameHub.placeCubeIgnition/Harmony -> engine.place only. Real material calls NativeCubeCastAction -> GameHub.nativeMaterialPlaceCube -> engine.nativeMaterialPlace; its original plain Cube constructor did not capture Source entity. Source HP consumers consequently dropped unbound actual material cubes; old metadata contracts did not establish that production path.',Source_contract='EffectCubeBurn/HarmonizeTimer.start uses CUBE_INTERVAL500 for global effect scans; separate L1Cube.begin uses initial900/period1000 status callbacks. Preserve callback4 ignition10/MP5 and callback5 harmony25; do not substitute500ms damage callbacks.',program_update='Actual two material Hub calls establish detached Draft from the original prewait Batch.accepted Ingress.binding, no fresh caster capture. Exact original material constructors delegate to existing Source metadata overload; bound entity/faction use original live engine/scene. Original geometry/admit/cost/allocation/list order is inverse-retained; publish scene only on accepted return, finally restore installing. Existing Source scene selects500ms scan at the original interval local; independent status clocks and unscoped/unloaded/WORLD scan remain original.',remaining='No bound caster/MP/reagent/cost rollback/HP/Main cases. Quake/Shock factory and status provenance, initial global scan phase, full Source geometry/type/relations/status presentation and role/life/Main matrix, full materials/controls/NPC factory-AI/formal composition remain open.'),
