 dict(id='ground-actual-material-staged-factory-correction',correction='The earlier ground-origin hook covered legacy GameHub.placeGroundSpell direct cast, not the actual NativeGroundMaterialAction.placeBattle -> GameHub.nativeMaterialPlaceGroundSpell -> NativeGroundMaterialAction.castBattle production factory. Its two disposable battleCopy engines originally created unbound leases, so prior metadata tests did not establish this production path.',program_update='Retain original preflight copy, cost callback/Rejected branch, second copy/recalculation and install order. Peek the actual current Batch and reuse accepted Ingress.binding captured by reserve before original player-lock wait. A detached Draft copies original scene/epoch into staged engines; new Entity points to original live engine, never a disposable copy. Original scene publication occurs only at original accepted install. Draft is restored in finally and never retains Batch/Ingress/Context/Frame.',remaining='No bound role/MP/reagent/rollback/HP/Main case. Full placement/cost/closure matrix, NPC firewall, Source numerical/interval/geometry/immunity/master-death and other material/Source routes remain open.'),
