 dict(id='ground-original-lease-pulse-tick-PC-raw-program',Source_contract='EffectFirewallTimer uses original effect master PC; WorldEffect requires effect and master registered, excludes master/dead targets and uses tile distance<=1. PC topc emits reaction then receiveDamage(user,damage,false,true), raw no accepted-hit figure plan. NPC tonpc filters reaction and passes original PC source. Source master membership, numerical/SKM0/SKD3 rules and interval remain separate requirements.',program_update='The legacy direct factory binds original scene/engine epoch and creator binding; the child material-placement stage corrects the actual two-copy production factory. Original pulse/tick captures target/source role/life at synchronized advance, preserves lease identity through immutable final metadata and rejects stale source/target before original RNG after original ordered pair waits. PC58 HP uses existing raw false/true consumer and its shared FIFO; reaction output uses original raw final-frame plus scene proof. Original raw action close clears the synchronous Context proof only after its existing completion/output lifecycle.',remaining='No actual HP/pair/role/receiver/Main cases. The child queued-ground stage carries detached scene/lease proof at the actual drain and Frame ports; complete boundary/scene-transition qualification remains open. Natural/controlled NPC and BOT/Time-NPC ground applicability, original effect NPC presentation, full interval/placement/numerical/type/immunity and master-death policy, all lifecycle matrix remain open. Competition gates and WORLD/unscoped/unsupported bodies are retained.'),
