 dict(id='hit-reaction-readonly-control-program',Source_contract='Source loads 系統_受擊無動作gfx.gfx_id at startup, applies only to NPC temp gfx, Set membership includes zero/negative and JDBC NULL=>0. SQLExceptions continue with empty or partial already-read rows; RO resolves real target id. Sorted login sync is a separate API.',program_update='One same-owned-readonly-startup SELECT feeds an immutable atomic gfx snapshot; catalog consumers and fallback original methods are retained. Loaded rows replace old fixed values; no hit-time SQL, connection/transaction ownership or PC-target classifier added.',static_direct_catalog_consumers=[r for r in relevant if r['callee_owner']=='local/lito381/server/BattleHitReactionSuppressCatalog' and r['callee']=='shouldSendDamageAction'],remaining='All other NPC explicit ACTION_Damage ports, ordinary attack target/RO client-sync paths, multiple resource-database routing, scene and receiver lifecycle require further review; no live MySQL or game qualification.'),
 dict(id='accepted-natural-Ref-feedback-dynamic-HP-port',Source_contract='LegacyDefenseFeedbackPlan runs precomputed Mortal Body/Joy only after accepted incoming HP and submits NPC receiveDamage as raw damage. The native Source callback is NativePlayerCommit.acceptedTail -> NativeCombatAttacker.acceptedFeedback -> original validated Ref damage -> a reflective Quest/Time HP dispatch, not merely the six direct legacy/static caller sites.',implementation_gate='Patch the single natural reflective port only after the original positive-damage/validFrame/live Ref checks. Pass the same Ref and already validated Live actor into a stateless bridge; require the matching accepted BATTLE Frame, original scoped raw Action, exact Ref kind/id/ABI/room/owner and same actual actor, then use the existing raw NPC mode0 FIFO. Original reflecting TLS restoration and controlled/WORLD bodies are inverse-retained. Stale scoped operands are handled drops; unsupported/unscoped cases keep the old full fallback. No reroll, fresh proof, queue/worker/field or persistence. The inspected sourcePlayerBattleCommit directly publishes death confirmation rather than endBattle; no new child wait or end coordinator is introduced. Real death-confirm/end/role/IO/Main and full raw/AI qualification remain open.'),
 dict(id='natural-NPC-raw-wand-accepted-feedback-shared-FIFO',Source_contract='LegacyDefenseFeedbackPlan releases Mortal Body and Joy of Pain only after accepted incoming HP, checks that the attacked NPC is alive, and calls NPC receiveDamage(defender,damage) without an ordinary magic display plan. It does not require the accepted defender to remain alive. HitReactionSuppressTable controls the separate damage-action packet; complete reader/consumer coverage remains open.',implementation_gate='The six retained native raw Quest/Time leaves in wand/Mortal/Joy callers discard the old int. A loaded Source BATTLE natural-NPC raw action now submits mode0 to the existing common actor FIFO/worker/claim/admission/capacity/Main. A final field on the original Origin carries only its detached original raw Member actor/accepted life/pose/dead policy; this permits the already accepted dead defender while preserving exact role/life proof. Ordinary nonraw source policy remains the full old body. The temporary raw admission is restored in finally and shares the original frozen audience; queued proof never retains Action/Context/Scope/Receipt/snapshot. Existing common accepted HPBAR/death/wave/end publication is reused; raw live-HPBAR still requires a live original source at producer and final Frame, while dead-meter cleanup remains independent. No fabricated HP acceptance or ordinary figures; all raw numerical, reaction suppression, controlled, unscoped, role/fatality/IO/Main and full Source qualification remain open.'),
 dict(id='scoped-PC-DAMAGE-poison-target-owned-clock-peer',Source_contract='L1DamagePoison.poisonTickCurrent receives damage with the frozen original attacker but does not gate the admitted target-owned tick on attacker dead/online state. Current target/status ownership and target lifecycle remain authoritative; expiration/cure does not manufacture a new attacker role.',implementation_gate='The original NativeSourceRawDamage.poison Action constructor now chooses no attacker peer only for Source BATTLE with an actual Scope.find(target), clockActive and frozen DAMAGE kind. The retained native clock path already passes null caster for that kind and uses raw false/true poison flags. This removes the outer attacker pair/liveness precondition while retaining target/raw/clock/HP/admission/Main/cleanup/attribution code byte-for-byte. No field, queue, worker, output or HP method changed; unscoped/nested/other-kind poison, full original attribution and actual bound death/role/IO/Main matrices remain open. Structural program repair only, zero new PC poison game cases.'),
 dict(id='NPC-Mind-Bone-Arm-original-Source-pre-HP-phase',Source_contract='The actual three skillmode start methods mutate MP/status before returning damage to L1SkillUse, which calls mode.start before the later HP commit gate. MIND_BREAK requires currentMp > requested and actual debit == requested before calculating damage. BONE_BREAK rolls only while inactive, applies86123 for2s; ARM_BREAKER installs nonrefreshing DMGUP2 before returning damage. These specific effects are not accepted-only target mutation plans.',implementation_gate='Retain exact native Mind/Bone bodies behind original source/action/admission/Hub/actual-NPC proof guards, and wrap the two native Arm leaves. Only actual native result records enable existing single NPC FIFO routing; stale/unexecuted prerequisites are handled drops, never synchronous fallback HP or fabricated success. An original owned publication scope is established before acquiring Hub/actor monitors. Bone send ports defer detached original receiver/source/target and status lease proof to the actual Frame; all8 Bone expiry writes rotate per-actor identity. Original PC/controlled/WORLD bodies and RNG/calculations remain inverse-retained. Complete numerical/role/IO/Main/formal/material/control qualification remains open.'),
 dict(id='NPC-directional-freeze-shock-actual-target-plans',Source_contract='L1SkillUse gates positive-damage target mutations on actual acceptance and uses the nonpositive direct branch separately. Freeze probability is calculated before commit. SHOCK_STUN draws its duration in the accepted target effect and spawns81162; freeze spawns81168 and publishes poison palette2.',implementation_gate='Ten natural NPC HP leaves in directional, centered/single freeze and both retained Shock BATTLE bodies join the existing target FIFO. Five original bodies reject changed pre-wait source/NPC proofs. Immutable original chance/d100/boss/erase data replace HP-snapshot survival estimates; once-only accepted mutation runs before wave/end, while Shock duration draws once in its accepted phase. Every18 original freeze/shock expiry write publishes bounded per-actor lease identity, including cancellation/reset/expiry; final frames reject exact-lease/expiry/life/role changes, even same-clock ABA. Original costs/calculation/PC/controlled/WORLD bodies retained. Exact source numerical/type/immunity/AI/corpse and actual pair/IO/Main matrices remain open; this is program wiring only.'),
 dict(id='single-NPC-accepted-target-inputs-and-requested-heal',Source_contract='L1SkillUse calculates thunder target mutation data before enqueue, carries the fixed millis in the accepted plan, sets heal to calculated damage for CHILL_TOUCH/VAMPIRIC_TOUCH, and adjusts current HP if alive only in target side effects. Queued target mutation and heal are released on actual HP acceptance; the accepted callback does not reroll.',implementation_gate='Natural Quest/Time single attack uses the existing original target FIFO with scalar/immutable Single metadata, precomputed thunder duration and already rolled confusion plus requested-heal amount. Before-body original source/target guard and common frozen cast snapshot survive waits. A once-only accepted hook runs before native wave/end publication, preserving fatal-target heal, and a bounded exact copy of native capped HP mutation carries only typed old-receiver output proof. Mind/Bone/Arm now preserve their actual Source pre-HP side effects under detached original-NPC proof and use their real results to admit the later FIFO HP leaf; no accepted-only side-effect port is appropriate for these skillmode methods. Full Source numerical/RNG applicability and actual bound role/fatality/IO/Main matrices remain open; this is not complete single-target or Source qualification.'),
 dict(id='NPC-area-magic-cast-snapshot-and-accepted-erase',Source_contract='L1SkillUse captures the ERASE_MAGIC timer lease during damage calculation, gates positive-damage target mutations on actual accepted HP, and queues nonpositive-damage side effects without an accepted HP event. SkillTargetMutationPlan.apply removes only that exact lease. Composite magic commit runs MagicHitCommitPlan before the accepted skill plan, so logical magic figure publication precedes target mutation.',implementation_gate='The two native area-cast producers now use pre-wait original source/NPC/generation/life/pose and original audience bindings, detached erase metadata in the existing shared NPC ticket, accepted figure publication then exact erase consumption, and an explicit nonpositive-damage direct exact-lease branch. Original cost/RNG/primary/Ctrl/kind/range bodies and WORLD fallback retained. Single-target and directional/freeze/shock have separately scoped program wiring; remaining raw/AI/controlled/healing and actual bound queue/role/IO/Main matrices remain open; area program wiring is not generic Source qualification.'),
 dict(id='natural-NPC-physical-accepted-doll-and-FIFO',Source_contract='PhysicalHitCommitPlan runs already calculated attack proc side effects after actual HP acceptance, before physical figures. Each accepted effect isolates RuntimeException, while nested skill and extra-damage enqueue remains nonblocking on the same target tail.',implementation_gate='Natural Quest/Time physical and its scoped doll skill/bonus HP now use detached typed tickets in the original actor FIFO and owned drainer. Original source/target role/life/scene/pose are captured before source waits; rolled proc and original summon stamp are carried without Context/Scope/Receipt. Five bounded accepted HP/publication siblings retain original wave/death structure, then reconstruct a synchronous Context with the original audience bindings, run accepted rolled doll once and publish figures. Generic magic/other roots, complete accepted MP/HP drains/durability/talent and whole Source physical math, real claim/fatality/role/IO/Main remain open; this program change is not full Source physical qualification.'),
 dict(id='installed-poison-original-attacker-and-accepted-HP',Source_contract='L1DamagePoison freezes the original attacker and target, accepts only PC/Monster kinds, and executes a current target-owned poison tick. PC uses false/true and Monster raw receiveDamage; tick does not require attacker alive or online. Cure cancels only that exact current status and does not withdraw an admitted damage event.',implementation_gate='Natural Quest/Time poison now captures original room/actor/life/generation at installation and queues detached poison tickets into the same target FIFO and existing owned drainer as cube/proc. Actual claim and original target life/scene guard HP; later poison expiry/replacement or attacker death cannot revoke admitted HP. Original source binding separately guards HPBAR/lawful and all final receivers. Accepted death/wave/spawn/end structure is retained by five bounded siblings. PC poison and broader Source NPC hate/AI/numerics, bound game/Main/final output matrices remain unqualified.'),
 dict(id='damage-only-original-application-domain',Source_contract='Source DamageCommitQueue uses one queued-damage PENDING_EVENTS domain, distinct from AI scheduling, with the lineage.damage.maxTargetPending/maxGlobalPending configuration and slot release before commitInternal.',implementation_gate='Queued native PC/NPC admission now reserves a final original-application damage ledger; original work pending remains separate for shutdown. Every queue claim/drop and failed publication must release the matching ledger, and idle/terminated must fence outstanding reservations. Other direct HP producers still need shared FIFO/admission, and real bound-owner shutdown/configuration validation remains deferred.'),
 dict(id='NPC-nonblocking-FIFO-and-capacity',Source_contract='DamageCommitQueue reserves global and local slots atomically before publication, nested events join the same tail, dedicated commit workers drain serially and the Source local/global slots are released at dequeue before actual HP or on explicit drop. Admission is nonblocking; no caller-side HP fallback runs when dispatch is rejected.',implementation_gate='Cube NPC uses the existing original actor queue and shared old proc drainer, keeps original owned worker/retry/drop/close paths and an actual claimed-event guard. Shared application capacity must avoid queue-to-admission inversion. Native claimed-slot release matches the Source dequeue timing. All other direct NPC producers and the remaining direct NPC producer ordering still need reconciliation; queued PC/NPC damage capacity is now a separate original-application ledger while AI credits retain original shutdown accounting; a cube-only FIFO is not whole Source NPC qualification.'),
 dict(id='cube-effect-master-attribution',Source_contract='Cube spell creation passes its original player to spawnEffect, which sets the actual effect master. Monster receiveDamage enqueues the actual effect; accepted NPC processing resolves the effect master for hate, player side effects, reward/death attribution and HPBAR, while actual HP does not require a currently online player. Terminal death hides already tracked HP meters.',implementation_gate='Keep effect identity separate from frozen original master binding/faction. Master retirement must not cancel otherwise valid raw NPC HP, and a new role cannot inherit master HPBAR/reward authority. Preserve actual commit outcome, original wave/reward structure and final receiver lifecycle; native direct encounter HP does not yet prove the Source asynchronous NPC FIFO.'),
