 dict(id='doll-separate-proc-kinds',Source_contract='DollProcAction.applySkill calls L1Magic.commit(damage,0); the PC actor selects L1MagicPc. Its outer default none applies to acceptedSkillPlan only: inner commitPc/commitNpc compose MagicHitCommitPlan. SKILL retains accepted magic figures and PC flags true/false. UnifiedProcExecutor applies DAMAGE_BONUS as a separate HP event AFTER skills, with magic figures BEFORE HP and PC flags false/false (allowDefenseFeedback=true). DAMAGE_REDUCTION remains its original defense calculation contribution.',implementation_gate='Preserve existing proc RNG once. Route SKILL, extra damage, and reduction separately; do not merge bonus HP into base physical HP or use skill flags/display timing for bonus.'),
